</p>
</div><div class="bde-fancy-container-1942-137 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-1942-149 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-1942-160 bde-f-text">
Explainers
</div>
</div><h3 class="bde-heading-1942-150 bde-heading">
More Than a Table
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-1942-151 bde-f-text">
Understand the terms behind the figures, from player options to the luxury tax and aprons.
</p>
</div>
</div>
</div><div id="standards" class="bde-fancy-container-1942-108 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<h2 class="bde-heading-1942-126 bde-heading">
Clarity Comes First</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-1942-127 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-1942-138 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<h3 class="bde-heading-1942-152 bde-heading">
Name the Number
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-1942-153 bde-f-text">
Salary, cap hit, guaranteed money and net worth answer different questions. We identify which measure a figure represents.
</p>
</div><div class="bde-fancy-container-1942-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<h3 class="bde-heading-1942-154 bde-heading">
Keep the Season Visible
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-1942-155 bde-f-text">
A future salary is not a past earning. Season labels and research dates put each figure in context.
</p>
</div><div class="bde-fancy-container-1942-140 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<h3 class="bde-heading-1942-156 bde-heading">
Be Clear About What Is Known
</h3><p class="bde-f-text-1942-157 bde-f-text">
Estimates are labeled. Missing information remains unconfirmed rather than becoming a zero.
</p>
</div>
</div><div class="bde-fancy-container-1942-128 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



